From 39a8680e5c67d42b8f96aecf842fc7846922cc4d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Schoder Philipp (BD/DPA-BDP3)" <Philipp.Schoder@de.bosch.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 09:30:39 +0200
Subject: feat(trino): Add HTTP proxy config for the Azure filesystem

Add azure.http-proxy, azure.http-proxy.username,
azure.http-proxy.password and azure.http-proxy.non-proxy-hosts.

When azure.http-proxy is set, the Azure SDK HTTP client routes requests
through the proxy using ProxyOptions, with optional basic credentials
and a list of hosts that bypass it. The password is marked security
sensitive. Nothing changes unless the new options are set.
